# data/maps/moerkeskoven.map - SKOVKANTEN, the hub of Moerkeskoven (package P11-maps-iso): a hand-authored ORTHO map, a 31 x 26 cell clearing in a 48 x 42 grid.
# Started from the generator exporter's draft (design2/generator/hub_moerkeskoven.map.draft) and changed by the merged zone graph (decision DX2):
# the Skovlift of Traetoppen is the ONLY way in and out, so the draft's three gates (farm, Hyggebyen, city) are replaced by ONE gate arch (warp_gate_stone)
# on the tip of the southern funnel, to traetoppen:from_skovlift; the Hulen mouth (cave_ring, east) leads to floor 1 (D2 generates and registers the floor
# when the hub is entered); the Port-runen (north) is the rune picker (D2); there is no npc slot (Fru Ugle lives in the city, Natteblik stands beside the
# Hulen of floors 2 / 6 / 10); the rim is void (rim.wall_depth 0: invisible blockers keep the player in) and the 37 rim crowns are @prop rows, three
# rings (touching the clearing, 4..7 cells out, 9..12 cells out) of the three crown sizes, none inside the funnel and none hiding a marker.
# Spawns: `default` and `from_traetoppen` lie on neighbouring cells in front of the gate (a cell holds ONE object char, so the Skovlift arrival is the
# neighbour of `default`), `from_floor` beside the Hulen mouth. Orthogonal map: text columns run right, rows run down.
# Ground chars: m forest floor, g glow floor (around the three glow lights), p moss path, ~ bog (ground_block), # void.
# This file is AUTHORITATIVE and hand-editable (it was derived once from the draft with a throwaway script that is not part of the repository);
# tests/sections/maps_iso.gd keeps it honest (one gate, reachability from the real colliders, the strings of areas.csv).
@id moerkeskoven
@title ZONE_FOREST_EDGE
@projection ortho
@ambient forest
@theme forest
@zone dark_forest
@depth 0
@flight false
@music forest_theme
# --- rim crowns (scenery, solid none; sizes S 170 / M 230 / L 300 px radius)
@prop N crown_s_b
@prop O crown_s_a
@prop P crown_m_b
@prop Q crown_m_a
@prop R crown_l_a
@prop S crown_l_b
# --- spawns (the default spawn is the '@' char), the ONE gate to the Skovlift of the city, the Hulen mouth, the Port-runen
@marker I spawn name=from_traetoppen
@marker A spawn name=from_floor
@marker E warp to=traetoppen spawn=from_skovlift label=ZONE_TRAETOPPEN prop=warp_gate_stone r=0
@marker B warp to=moerkeskoven_f1 spawn=default label=ZONE_DARK_FOREST prop=cave_ring r=0
@marker C runestone id=rune_hub hub=1
# --- the strings of this package's areas.csv: the sign, the whisper zone; three glow lights; the look marker of V8
@marker K sign text=SIGN_MOERKESKOVEN_HUB
@marker L whisper text=SIGN_MOERKESKOVEN_WHISPER r=2
@marker M light kind=glow r=170 h=30 prop=glow_mushroom_cluster
@marker D forest_dress fireflies=40 mist=2 unshaded=1
@marker Z secret_garden kind=trail
@ground
